CORE
initial3.smv
--aiger
^aag [0-9]+ 0 4 0 [0-9]+ 0 2$
^2 2 2$
^4 4 4$
^6 6 6$
^([0-9]+) 0 1$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
The initial-state constraint does not fix any latch value. The latches
are uninitialised, and the constraint is an AIGER invariant constraint
that is enforced by an additional latch that is 1 only in the initial
state.
